# URL of the cotelligent-hrms frontend. When staff (HR/Admin) log out here,
# they're sent back to HRMS's "HR Operation" modules page — that's where the
# SSO handoff from the "Alumni" tile brought them in from — rather than to
# this app's own login screen. The alumni self-service portal logout is
# unaffected (goes to "/" as before; alumni users don't come from HRMS).
VITE_HRMS_URL=http://localhost:3000
